/UserDocuments/
/ImportedCharts/
/Imports/
/ChartBridgeLibrary/
/private/

# Local historical reports contain workstation paths/account usage.
# Preserve on disk; portable engineering/accuracy documentation is tracked.
/Docs/NextSessionHandoff.md
/Docs/VerificationReview.md

